# Start robot: the first button of the operator console (ADR-0071).
#
# Initializes every physical side's arm (`InitializeAsset`, on that side's own
# domain; nothing on an all-simulated pair), then reads the plant arm's custody
# and refuses an arm that says it holds a part. Commands no arm motion of its
# own; on a physical side the initializer may home the track and bring the
# carriage to the program's start (InitializeAsset.srv). Until it succeeds the
# console refuses Home and Start program. Refused while another request runs.
#
# Served under `/cite/<zone>/console/<NAME>` (ConsoleState.msg says how the
# name is composed).

string NAME="start_robot"
---
bool success   # the arm is started; the console is READY
string detail  # what was done, or why it was refused or failed
